<sect1 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_DCC_EX3_CONTINUOUS_MONITORING_OF_CLOCK_SYSCFG_1autotoc_md192">
<title>Calculation Details</title>
<para><verbatim>  Since Fclk1&gt;Fclk0, Async. Error (In Clock0 cycles) = 2 + 2*(Fsysclk/Fclk0)

  Digitization error (In Clock0 cycles) = 8

  DCC Error = Async. Error + Digitization error

  Window (in Cycles) = (DCC Error) / (0.01 * Tolerance)


  Frequency Error Allowed (In Clock0 Cycles)
                        = Window * (Allowable Frequency Tolerance (in %) / 100)

  Total Error = DCC Error + Frequency Error Allowed

  Counter0 = Window - Total Error

  Valid0   = 2 * Total Error 

  Counter1 = Window x (Fclk1/Fclk0)
</verbatim></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Above calculation is done as part of sysconfig in this example</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect1>
